          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}37\\times9\\times3&=37\\times3\\times9\\\\37\\times9\\times3&=111\\times9\\\\37\\times9\\times3&=999\\end{align*}$$\nMultiplying $111$ by $9$ gives three digits equal to $9$.",
